      "writtenOn": "2023-04-17T13:03:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Once `query_vendor_hyp_call_uid()` returns a `Uuid`, we can just implement a `TryFrom` from `Uuid` to `HypervisorBackend`, then this function can just be\n```\npub fn detect_hypervisor() -\u003e Result\u003c()\u003e {\n     HYPERVISOR \u003d query_vendor_hyp_call_uid().try_into()?;\n     Ok(())\n}\n```\n\nbtw, can we just make HYPERVISOR a lazy_static so that it doesn\u0027t need to be mutable?",
      "parentUuid": "f2382c78_9bb521ac",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 88,
